  ["feature.bard-subclass.xphb2024.bard.base.3"]={title="Bard Subclass",subtitle="Caracteristica - XPHB - 2024",body="Pagina: 60\n\nYou gain a Bard subclass of your choice. A subclass is a specialization that grants you features at certain Bard levels. For the rest of your career, you gain each of your subclass's features that are of your Bard level or lower."},
